  "texts": {
    "preamble": "K.N.Abdul Gafoor vs The State Of Kerala on 3 January, 2022 Author: K.Haripal Bench: K.Haripal In The High Court Of Kerala At Ernakulam Present The Honourable Mr. Justice K.Haripal Monday, The 3Rd Day Of January 2022 / 13Th Pousha, 1943 Crl.Mc No. 554 Of 2021 Crime No. 592/2020 Of The Central Police Station, Ernakulam Petitioner: K.N.Abdul Gafoor Aged 55 Years, S/O.Late C.K.Kasmi, Residing At Rangoon, 37/2127 A, Kathrikadavu, Kaloor, Kochi, Pin-686668. By Adv. John Mathew (Therezhath) Respondents: 1 The State Of Kerala Represented By Public Prosecutor, District Court, Ernakulam. 2 The Station House Officer, Central Police Station, Ernakulam, Pin-682017. 3 Haji K.V.Abdulla Kutty, Aged 70 Years, S/O.Moideenkunhi, Residing At Dar Es Salam House, Vattampadam Vadakkekad, Thrissur District, Nhamanghat, Thrissur District, Pin-679563. 4 A.C.Devy, Aged 45 Years Advocate And Notary Roll No.K/355/1996, Infant Jesus Building, Iind Floor, Near Kerala High Court, Ernakulam-682031. R1 & R2 By Sri. Noushad P.A., Senior Public Prosecutor R3 By Sri.Haris Beeran Smt.O.A.Nuriya R4 By Adv. Sri.A.M.Abdulla K.N.Abdul Gafoor vs The State Of Kerala on 3 January, 2022 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/186546092/ 1 This Criminal Misc. Case Having Come Up For Admission On 03.01.2022, The Court On The Same Day Passed The Following: Crl.M.C.No.554 Of 2021 2 Order",
    "facts": "Petitioner is the first accused in Crime No. 592/2020 of Ernakulam Central Police Station registered on 24.05.2020, at the instance of the third respondent where offence under Sections 406, 417, 468, 471 read with 34 of the Indian Penal Code is alleged against the petitioner and the fourth respondent. The case is under investigation. By the time, the petitioner moved this Court for quashing the proceedings. THE TRUE COPY OF THE FIR NO.592 OF 2020 DATED 24.05.2020 REGISTERED AT THE CENTRAL POLICE STATION IN ERNAKULAM. ANNEXURE A2 THE TRUE COPY OF THE LEASE DEED DATED 15.03.2017 EXECUTED BY AND BETWEEN THE PETITIONER AND THE DEFACTO COMPLAINANT AND HIS WIFE WITH RESPECT TO THE SHOP ROOM BEARING NO.66/4270 OF COCHIN CORPORATION. ANNEXURE A2(A) THE TRUE COPY OF THE LEASE DEED DATED 15.03.2017 EXECUTED BY AND BETWEEN THE PETITIONER AND THE DEFACTO COMPLAINANT AND HIS WIFE RESPECT TO THE SHOP ROOM BEARING NO.66/4271 OF COCHIN CORPORATION. ANNEXURE A4 THE TRUE COPY OF THE REGISTRATION CERTIFICATE NO.21319185000907 DATED 12.11.2019 ISSUED TO THE FIRM UNDER THE FOOD SAFETY AND STANDARDS ACT 2006. ANNEXURE A5 THE TRUE COPY OF THE NOTICE BEARING NO.32/HIC-19/2019-20 DATED 01.11.2019 ISSUED BY THE CORPORATION TO THE PETITIONER. ANNEXURE A6 THE TRUE COPY OF THE NOTICE BEARING NO.ISO/MOH15/00394/2020 DATED 04.03.2020 ISSUED BY THE COCHIN CORPORATION TO THE PETITIONER. ANNEXURE A8 THE TRUE COPY OF THE COMPLAINTS DATED 16.03.2020 LODGED BY THE PETITIONER BEFORE THE 2ND RESPONDENT AND THE DISTRICT POLICE CHIEF AND THE RELEVANT RECEIPTS ISSUED THERETO. ANNEXURE A9 THE TRUE COPY OF THE LEGAL NOTICES DATED 14.07.2020 ISSUED BY THE DEFACTO COMPLAINANT TO THE PETITIONER.",
